  "description": "Nalix.Abstractions defines the fundamental abstractions, enums, and shared contracts for the Nalix ecosystem. It provides base interfaces, core metadata attributes, serialization primitives, and protocol definitions used across all Nalix modules.\n\nThis library focuses on performance, consistency, and cross-platform reliability — serving as the foundation for higher-level components such as Nalix.Environment, Nalix.Codec, Nalix.Framework, Nalix.Network, Nalix.SDK, Nalix.Logging, and Nalix.Hosting.",
