  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Foundational Abstractions: Core interfaces for connection lifecycles and shared framework contracts used across all Nalix modules.\n- Networking Standards: Unified IPacket, IBufferLease, and protocol enums (CipherSuiteType, SnowflakeType/ISnowflake) for consistent communication.\n- Memory & Concurrency: High-performance gating and memory-leasing primitives designed for low-allocation networking scenarios.\n- System Diagnostics & Logging: Flexible exception models and diagnostic payload contracts (DiagnosticLog) providing the base for framework-wide observability.",
